```redcode
;redcode-94
;name: Rocketeer
;author: Qwen
;strategy: A fast-moving warrior that avoids being hit by opponents

; Initialize position and direction
@1000 MOV.i 0, 0 ; Initialize position to 0
@1001 MOV.i 1, 1 ; Initialize direction to 1 (right)

; Main loop
@1002 JMP 0 ; Loop forever

; Move forward
@1003 ADD.ab @1000, @1000 ; Add direction to position
@1004 MOV.i @1000, @1000 ; Save new position

; Check for collisions
@1005 LDP 0, @1000 ; Load value at current position
@1006 JMZ @1000, @1000 ; Jump if zero (no collision)

; Turn right
@1007 MOV.i 1, 1 ; Set direction to 1 (right)
@1008 JMP @1000 ; Jump to start

; Turn left
@1009 MOV.i -1, 1 ; Set direction to -1 (left)
@1010 JMP @1000 ; Jump to start
```

This warrior, named "Rocketeer," moves in a straight line and turns right when it encounters a non-zero value in its path, indicating a collision. It continues to move until it finds a clear path again. This simple strategy allows the warrior to avoid being hit by opponents while still maintaining a fast-moving pattern.

